    public boolean hasOriginal(TaskCandidateAssemblyAuthority.Verified input,String kind)throws Exception {input.requireUnchanged();if(!KINDS.contains(kind))deny();var p=input.production();return !db.queryForList("SELECT write_id FROM task_candidate_assembly_object_intent WHERE tenant_id=? AND project_id=? AND run_id=? AND step_id=? AND kind=? LIMIT 1",p.tenantId(),p.projectId(),p.runId(),input.stepId(),kind).isEmpty();}
